--- !u!114 &248461888
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 248461883}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 909abf83c6323af459785be6bf3be77c, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  LevelNum: 0
  Description: This is the base screen of the case. Here you'll see the description
    of the case. Go to the Locations
  CaseList:
  - CardFace: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d182f27cb493ae3458f73910586a02b5, type: 3}
    Name: Tap Me
    Description: Here you see the description of the location. Press the X and go
      to the Weapons.
    IsInCase: 0
    Type: 0
  - CardFace: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 259e58a1920861c4cbdbf5198b1e41f8, type: 3}
    Name: Tap Me
    Description: This is the page where the weapons will be. But not all items are
      the same. Tap the Sword
    IsInCase: 0
    Type: 1
  - CardFace: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2cc7eadc17fdfd444aa3e1f9b877226e, type: 3}
    Name: Sword
    Description: All items until now were Investigation items. When the item bellongs
      to the case it needs to be clicked from Ready Mode. Tap the Spear with Ready
      Mode.
    IsInCase: 0
    Type: 1
  - CardFace: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 94db71bbd87fe24428539dffa17cf762, type: 3}
    Name: Spear
    Description: This is an item that was used in the case (a murder weapon or something
      like that). Go to the People page and tap on John with Ready Mode.
    IsInCase: 1
    Type: 1
  - CardFace: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e3cb75d5cc920b24987c45054b5a0efe, type: 3}
    Name: John
    Description: Whenever you tap someone with the wrong mode you lose a life. Tap
      on Luna with Ready Mode.
    IsInCase: 0
    Type: 3
  - CardFace: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 33c10046bb0d840498dd974bedb39737, type: 3}
    Name: Luna
    Description: So, you should be choosing only items related to the case with ready
      mode. Tap on Joanna with Investigation Mode to end the tutorial.
    IsInCase: 1
    Type: 3
  - CardFace: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e3cb75d5cc920b24987c45054b5a0efe, type: 3}
    Name: John
    Description: Good Job!
    IsInCase: 1
    Type: 3
